<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes down in heavy trading.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes down in heavy trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>1300 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes lower in heavy trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>* down 1.7 points, 0.15 percent, to 1,150.6</p>
<p>* Turnover, 36.4 million crowns</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom drops 10 crowns to 3,350</p>
<p>* RIF rises 15 crowns to 939</p>
<p>* Chemopetrol loses 20 crowns to 1,205</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka gains 14 crowns to 2,345</p>
<p>* CEZ up five crowns to 1,054</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
